578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":12,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-b-c8e6ba0e3c13c1f81388","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-c8e6ba0e3c13c1f81388","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗安：即袁安（？—公元 92）。字邵公。出自世代传习《周易》的儒学家族。以政绩优异，自县长逐渐迁升。东汉章帝时历任司空、司徒。自他之后，袁氏子孙连续三代出任三公，门生下属遍于天下，与弘农杨氏并列为东汉最著名的世家大族。传见《后汉书》卷四十五。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7581a2f0a0b3888f8d51","start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o029","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-96823a188ae2ce80134d","layer":"original","quote":"袁绍字本初，汝南汝阳人也〖1〗。高祖父安〖2〗，为汉司徒。自安以下，四世居三公位，由是势倾天下。﹝一﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p053","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9e9f888b25d6ea1dc29c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞华峤《汉书》曰：“安字邵公。好学有威重。明帝时为楚郡太守，治楚王狱。所申理者四百余家，皆蒙全济，安遂为名臣。章帝时至司徒，生蜀郡太守京。京弟敞，为司空。京子汤，太尉。汤四子：长子平；平弟成，左中郎将：并早卒。成弟逢，逢弟隗：皆为公。”","attribution":"华峤《汉书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p054","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-4721c54c5b6ec0b6f42b","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“自安以下，皆博爱容众，无所拣择。宾客入其门，无贤愚皆得所欲，为天下所归。绍即逢之庶子，术异母兄也；出后成，为子。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c01fb7f7704df4169afc","start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
